{"pageid":702,"title":"Adurite Key","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Adurite Key</span>","revid":19040,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Adurite Key</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Key.png/revision/latest?cb=20230314220502\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Key\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Key.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20230314220502\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Key.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20230314220502 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Key.png/revision/latest?cb=20230314220502 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Key\" width=\"270\" height=\"148\" data-image-key=\"Key.png\" data-image-name=\"Key.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$48,200 (in materials and Large Bombs)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Creating the Emberbane Axe</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 13th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>-\"??&#160;??&#160;???&#160;?\"-</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Scaffoldin_area.png/revision/latest?cb=20240902064418\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Where to find Scaffolding (look on roof)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0f/Scaffoldin_area.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240902064418\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"101\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Scaffoldin area.png\" data-image-key=\"Scaffoldin_area.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Scaffoldin_area.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Where to find Scaffolding (look on roof)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Adurite Key</b> is a special quest item obtained by completing the <i>Pedestal Puzzle</i>, which involves placing three different Refined tools (the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Chisel\" title=\"Refined Chisel\">Refined Chisel</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Pickaxe\">Refined Pickaxe</a>) onto their respective pedestals. This key is part of a larger puzzle required to make the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a> axe. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Adurite Key is a skeleton key with a heptagonally shaped ring, a long shaft and two equal-size teeth. It appears to be rusty and corroded. This item is roughly 2.5 studs in length.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>Note: It is advised to do this quest on a solo/private server. When the Key spawns, it doesn't have an owner, which can result in it being stolen.</i></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Go to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> from the Finlay Island entrance. Keep right until you see a large lake with wood planks suspended above it near the cave roof. Locate the rusty truss (ladder) and parkour across the planks until you reach the designated location. After climbing the truss you should see a little room in the cave ceiling with the red button at the end, surrounded by floating red particles. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/r2fjzUCArGU?si=rFMUhkhAhltSHqTf\">Watch this video</a> to see how to complete the parkour without the usage of a gravity coil. <b>If the button is nowhere to be seen, this means that a person in your server already toggled the quest, you can then skip that part and go to the next quest</b></li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li>\n<li>Buy the required refined tools found at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>, these being: <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a> [$21,000], <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Chisel\" title=\"Refined Chisel\">Refined Chisel</a> [$5,000], <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Pickaxe\" title=\"Refined Pickaxe\">Refined Pickaxe</a> [$21,000]. The total price of these items is $47,000.</li>\n<li>Bring the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a> onto the pedestal located infront of <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>. If done correctly, the pedestal will emit green particles.</li>\n<li>Bring the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Chisel\" title=\"Refined Chisel\">Refined Chisel</a> onto the pedestal located at the bottom of the canyon, underneath the right bridge.</li>\n<li>Bring the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Pickaxe\">Refined Pickaxe</a> onto the pedestal located just before the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>, in the middle of the lost forest.</li>\n<li>If successful, the items on the pedestals will disappear, the green lines will appear, and then you will hear 3 \"poof\" sounds followed by a loud bang. Immediately drive to the highest point where <a href=\"/wiki/Corpse_Flower\" title=\"Corpse Flower\">Corpse Flowers</a> are found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acid Wastes</a> to claim your Adurite Key, which awaits atop the pedestal.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Map_Guide\">Map Guide</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-none show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/99/PedestalsGuide.png/revision/latest?cb=20230824055732\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"(Credits to @timeywimeywaiwey on Discord)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/99/PedestalsGuide.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230824055732\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"129\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"PedestalsGuide.png\" data-image-key=\"PedestalsGuide.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:PedestalsGuide.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><i>(Credits to @timeywimeywaiwey on Discord)</i></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the first quest item to be added into <i>Oaklands</i>.</li>\n<li>The developers had to alter the puzzle due to being too difficult to solve when it was initially implemented.</li>\n<li>This item has been renamed to <i>\"Adurite Key\"</i>.</li>\n<li>Obtaining this item is similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a>'s obtainment.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902203443\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 103/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 3/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1584465/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.949      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   26.949      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:702-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902203443 and revision id 19040. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Quest_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Refined Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Chisel","exists":true},{"title":"Refined Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true},{"title":"Corpse Flower","exists":true},{"title":"Emberbane","exists":true},{"title":"Lighthouse","exists":true},{"title":"Mike's Mines","exists":true},{"title":"Tall Refined Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Tall Refined Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Uncertain Pickaxe","exists":true}],"images":["Key.png","Scaffoldin_area.png","PedestalsGuide.png"]}
